meta {
  name: UC3 Unchanged and metadata PATCH
  seq: 3
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Re-registering identical content produces one SKIPPED run with no Bedrock or database work.
  Patching metadata produces a METADATA run: the chunks' metadata is updated in place, no
  re-embedding, no new version. Both count as skipped for the process.
}
